{"title":"일요일의 위로 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"X같은 월요일, 짜증나는 화요일… 버티는 금요일, 순삭되는 토요일.그저 일요일에 평화롭게 위로를 받으며, 평범한 회사원으로 살고 싶은 정라원.그러나 인생에 도움이 안 되는 동생 정지원 때문에, 직장 상사 현제오에게 잘못 찍히는데….\"키스 한번 하자고. 정라원이 나한테.\"얽히고 싶지 않은 현제오 상무.그렇지만 그가 이끄는 제주도 리조트 오픈 TF팀에 발탁되고….평범하게 회사 생활하다 정년퇴임하고 싶은 라원은 과연, 자신의 꿈을 사수할 수 있을까?!#리맨물 #현대물 #능글공 #후회공 #수한정다정공 #능력수 #단정수 #강수","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":166,"change":{"type":"down","amount":87}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":123,"change":{"type":"up","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":141,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":175,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":144,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":155,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":158,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":198,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":220,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":254,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":125}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":154,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":187,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-09-0